# Plastic SCM
*.ignore.conf
AGraveyardShift.zip

# ---- Bought assets whose licence forbids sharing the raw files (this repo is public) ----
# Ice Ching "Provincial Church" (church-PSX.zip, bought 2026-11-24). The .meta files stay in git so the GUIDs
# and import settings survive; put the files themselves back from the zip. The 12-bay shell mesh is made from
# the pack's model, so it stays local too (regenerate it with Tools > Graveyard > Church Rework > Apply).
/AGraveyardShift/Assets/Church Rework/Provincial Church/**
!/AGraveyardShift/Assets/Church Rework/Provincial Church/**/
!/AGraveyardShift/Assets/Church Rework/Provincial Church/**/*.meta
/AGraveyardShift/Assets/Church Rework/Generated/Church shell (12 bays).asset
